WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:21.561
"I want to drive a car!" said Kip.

2
00:00:21.562 --> 00:00:26.905
"I don't want to drive a car," said Bird.

3
00:00:26.906 --> 00:00:30.689
"Cars are too fast."

4
00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.916
"Vroom! Vroom!" said Kip.

5
00:00:34.917 --> 00:00:37.244
Kip zoomed along the branch.

6
00:00:37.245 --> 00:00:41.154
"I'm a race car driver!" he said.

7
00:00:41.155 --> 00:00:45.567
Kip zoomed up and down the tree trunk.

8
00:00:45.568 --> 00:00:49.390
"I'm a fast race car driver!" he said.

9
00:00:49.391 --> 00:00:52.933
"And I'm going to win the big race!"

10
00:00:52.934 --> 00:00:55.089
Bird was watching Kip.

11
00:00:55.090 --> 00:00:58.047
"Be careful, Kip," she said.

12
00:00:58.048 --> 00:01:03.350
"Vroom! Vroom! Vroom!" said Kip.

13
00:01:03.351 --> 00:01:07.344
"You are running very fast," said Bird.

14
00:01:07.345 --> 00:01:11.879
"You mean I'm driving very fast!" said Kip.

15
00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:15.850
"And you're not being very careful," said Bird.

16
00:01:15.851 --> 00:01:22.230
"Nobody is faster than me!" said Kip.

17
00:01:22.231 --> 00:01:24.643
Just then Kip tripped.

18
00:01:24.644 --> 00:01:27.023
He went flying into the air.

19
00:01:27.024 --> 00:01:29.297
"Oh no!" cried Kip.

20
00:01:29.298 --> 00:01:32.153
"Oh no!" cried Bird.

21
00:01:32.154 --> 00:01:34.084
Crash!

22
00:01:34.085 --> 00:01:37.858
Kip smashed right into Bird's nest!
